{
    "title": "Solitaire Farm Adventure Games",
    "description": "Explore the worldwide solitaire harvest fun in our grand - Farm Adventure: TriPeaks Solitaire! Join Jane\u2019s family farm to experience the fun of solitaire card games and start your unique farm life from American Farming to African Farming and also European Farming, etc. Enjoy free solitaire card games and immerse yourself with a stimulating farming experience. \r\n\r\nTired of the classic farming game? Then follow our friends on the farm to experience different farming work in all corners of the world and set off for happy farm adventures. Build a charming pony town, care for adorable farm animals, explore the sunny forest, create a fantastic farm story and capture all the memories into your farming live album. \r\n\r\nAlongside the harvest farm adventure, captivating and free tripeaks solitaire will bring you endless tripeaks card game experience and exciting harvest fun. For all types of solitaire lovers: classic solitaire, freecell, pyramid solitaire, tiki solitaire and other free tripeaks solitaire card games. It\u2019s free to play your favorite tripeaks solitaire on the sim farm.\r\n\r\n\u2660\ufe0f SOLITAIRE TRIPEAKS FARM ADVENTURE FEATURES: \r\n- Over 10,000 free solitaire levels - more added every 2 weeks!\r\n- Daily harvest your growing crops and vegetables\r\n- Build and renovate your own farm on the harvest land\r\n- Play with Jane, Bob and Biscuit and meet more lovely farm animal friends\r\n- Collect grand bonuses in tripeaks solitaire card games\r\n- Join Mini-games and win grand tripeaks card prizes\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf3e\u200dEXPLORE beautiful farmville\r\n- Build your own farm from the farmland into the sizable farming town\r\n- Grow tons of various crops and vegetables and meet different animal friends around the world\r\n- Discover the epic solitaire story and unlock mysterious farm harvest adventure\r\n- Win grand and mysterious tripeaks solitaire rewards as your farming skills improve\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udccfSolitaire with a fun twist\r\n- Classic solitaire tripeaks with valuable hidden treasures\r\n- Obstacle Cards of Locks, Shells, Stones, Bombs, Volcanos, and more. These powerful cards will show you how fun a solitaire tripeaks card game can be!\r\n- Level up to unlock more solitaire card gameplay\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf3eFARMING with daily harvest bonus\r\n- Expand your harvest fun and get your free harvest credits everyday\r\n- Complete tripeaks solitaire card games to explore the delightful farmville and unique farming experience\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6Compete in solitaire tournaments\r\n- Play real solitaire and compete against players from all over the world\r\n- Test your full deck solitaire skills and play cards online to climb tournament rankings\r\n\r\nNo Wi-Fi? No Worries! Enjoy the tripeaks classic card games and relaxing farm adventure free offline. Join in this stimulating TriPeaks Farm Adventure with a variety of bonuses like coins, Magic Boosters, and grand solitaire prizes. \r\n\r\nSet off on your Solitaire TriPeaks Farm Adventure today and experience the farming heyday. Download this solitaire card game for free and enjoy unlimited solitaire levels while indulging in the enchanting farming adventure!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Explore the worldwide solitaire harvest fun in our grand - Farm Adventure: TriPeaks Solitaire! Join Jane\u2019s family farm to experience the fun of solitaire card games and start your unique farm life from American Farming to African Farming and also European Farming, etc. Enjoy free solitaire card games and immerse yourself with a stimulating farming experience. <br><br>Tired of the classic farming game? Then follow our friends on the farm to experience different farming work in all corners of the world and set off for happy farm adventures. Build a charming pony town, care for adorable farm animals, explore the sunny forest, create a fantastic farm story and capture all the memories into your farming live album. <br><br>Alongside the harvest farm adventure, captivating and free tripeaks solitaire will bring you endless tripeaks card game experience and exciting harvest fun. For all types of solitaire lovers: classic solitaire, freecell, pyramid solitaire, tiki solitaire and other free tripeaks solitaire card games. It\u2019s free to play your favorite tripeaks solitaire on the sim farm.<br><br>\u2660\ufe0f SOLITAIRE TRIPEAKS FARM ADVENTURE FEATURES: <br>- Over 10,000 free solitaire levels - more added every 2 weeks!<br>- Daily harvest your growing crops and vegetables<br>- Build and renovate your own farm on the harvest land<br>- Play with Jane, Bob and Biscuit and meet more lovely farm animal friends<br>- Collect grand bonuses in tripeaks solitaire card games<br>- Join Mini-games and win grand tripeaks card prizes<br><br>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf3e\u200dEXPLORE beautiful farmville<br>- Build your own farm from the farmland into the sizable farming town<br>- Grow tons of various crops and vegetables and meet different animal friends around the world<br>- Discover the epic solitaire story and unlock mysterious farm harvest adventure<br>- Win grand and mysterious tripeaks solitaire rewards as your farming skills improve<br><br>\ud83c\udccfSolitaire with a fun twist<br>- Classic solitaire tripeaks with valuable hidden treasures<br>- Obstacle Cards of Locks, Shells, Stones, Bombs, Volcanos, and more. These powerful cards will show you how fun a solitaire tripeaks card game can be!<br>- Level up to unlock more solitaire card gameplay<br><br>\ud83c\udf3eFARMING with daily harvest bonus<br>- Expand your harvest fun and get your free harvest credits everyday<br>- Complete tripeaks solitaire card games to explore the delightful farmville and unique farming experience<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6Compete in solitaire tournaments<br>- Play real solitaire and compete against players from all over the world<br>- Test your full deck solitaire skills and play cards online to climb tournament rankings<br><br>No Wi-Fi? No Worries! Enjoy the tripeaks classic card games and relaxing farm adventure free offline. Join in this stimulating TriPeaks Farm Adventure with a variety of bonuses like coins, Magic Boosters, and grand solitaire prizes. <br><br>Set off on your Solitaire TriPeaks Farm Adventure today and experience the farming heyday. Download this solitaire card game for free and enjoy unlimited solitaire levels while indulging in the enchanting farming adventure!",
